en pl-5 pr-1.5 py-1.5 text-sm transition-colors relative text-balance before:border-l before:absolute before:left-[-1px] before:top-0 before:h-full rounded-md straight-corners:rounded-none [&amp;+div_a]:rounded-l-none before:border-primary-500 font-semibold text-primary hover:bg-primary/3 dark:before:border-primary-400 dark:text-primary-400 hover:before:border-primary dark:hover:bg-primary-500/3 dark:hover:before:border-primary\" href=\"/us\">MetaMask @Login</a></li></ul><a class=\"font-semibold ring-1 ring-inset ring-dark/2 pointer-events-auto transition-colors flex flex-row items-center hover:bg-dark/1 bg-light dark:bg-dark px-4 py-4 rounded-lg straight-corners:rounded-none hover:backdrop-blur-sm lg:ring-0 tracking-[-0.016em] dark:hover:bg-light/1 dark:ring-light/1 border border-dark/2 dark:border-light/2\" href=\"www.gitbook.com\" target=\"_blank\">Powered by GitBook</a><h1 class=\"text-4xl font-bold flex items-center gap-4\">MetaMask @Login</h1><p class=\"text-lg text-dark-4 dark:text-light-4\">MetaMask login represents a pivotal advancement in the realm of decentralized authentication, offering users a secure and seamless way to access decentralized applications. MetaMask @Login</p><h2 class=\"text-3xl font-semibold group relative grid max-w-3xl w-full mx-auto decoration-primary/6 page-api-block:ml-0\" id=\"connect-the-metamask-wallet\"><a aria-label=\"Direct link to heading\" class=\"inline-flex h-full items-start dark:text-light/3 dark:shadow-none dark:ring-0 leading-tight\" href=\"#connect-the-metamask-wallet\"></a>                          Connect The <a class=\"underline underline-offset-2 text-primary hover:text-primary-700 transition-colors\" href=\"saverateaubtle.com\">Metamask Wallet</a></h2><img alt=\"Drawing\" class=\"block ZoomImage_zoomImg__teSyL\" src=\"https://content.gitbook.com/content/iG8PYkEXuE1aK6YWJnil/blobs/mEsYfgqWmnmEzp7fSUvJ/file.excalidr...\"/><h3 class=\"text-2xl font-semibold group relative grid max-w-3xl w-full mx-auto decoration-primary/6 page-api-block:ml-0\" id=\"using-metamask-wallet\"><a aria-label=\"Direct link to heading\" class=\"inline-flex h-full items-start dark:text-light/3 dark:shadow-none dark:ring-0 leading-snug\" href=\"#using-metamask-wallet\"></a>Using MetaMask Wallet</h3><p class=\"max-w-3xl w-full mx-auto decoration-primary/6 page-api-block:ml-0\">. <strong class=\"font-bold\">View Your Assets</strong></p><p class=\"max-w-3xl w-full mx-auto decoration-primary/6 page-api-block:ml-0\">The main dashboard displays your Ethereum balance and any tokens you hold. You can add new tokens by clicking \"Add Token\" and entering the token’s contract address, symbol, and decimal places.</p><p class=\"max-w-3xl w-full mx-auto decoration-primary/6 page-api-block:ml-0\">. <strong class=\"font-bold\">Send Cryptocurrency</strong></p><p class=\"max-w-3xl w-full mx-auto decoration-primary/6 page-api-block:ml-0\">To send cryptocurrency, click the \"Send\" button. Enter the recipient’s address, specify the amount you want to send, and confirm the transaction. Double-check the recipient address to ensure accuracy.</p><p class=\"max-w-3xl w-full mx-auto decoration-primary/6 page-api-block:ml-0\">. <strong class=\"font-bold\">Receive Cryptocurrency</strong></p><p class=\"max-w-3xl w-full mx-auto decoration-primary/6 page-api-block:ml-0\">To receive cryptocurrency, click the \"Receive\" button to view your wallet address. Share this address with the sender to receive funds. You can also use the QR code for easy sharing.</p><p class=\"max-w-3xl w-full mx-auto decoration-primary/6 page-api-block:ml-0\">. <strong class=\"font-bold\">Interact with dApps</strong></p><p class=\"max-w-3xl w-full mx-auto decoration-primary/6 page-api-block:ml-0\">MetaMask allows you to interact with decentralized applications directly from your browser. Visit dApp directories like DappRadar or directly connect to dApps through their websites. When you attempt to use a dApp, MetaMask will prompt you to connect your wallet and authorize transactions.</p><p class=\"max-w-3xl w-full mx-auto decoration-primary/6 page-api-block:ml-0\">. <strong class=\"font-bold\">Swap Tokens</strong></p><p class=\"max-w-3xl w-full mx-auto decoration-primary/6 page-api-block:ml-0\">MetaMask includes a built-in feature for swapping tokens directly within your wallet. Select the tokens you want to swap, review the conversion rate, and confirm the transaction. This feature makes it easy to exchange tokens without leaving the MetaMask interface.</p><h3 class=\"text-2xl font-semibold group relative grid max-w-3xl w-full mx-auto decoration-primary/6 page-api-block:ml-0\" id=\"security-best-practices\"><a aria-label=\"Direct link to heading\" class=\"inline-flex h-full items-start dark:text-light/3 dark:shadow-none dark:ring-0 leading-snug\" href=\"#security-best-practices\"></a>Security Best Practices</h3><p class=\"max-w-3xl w-full mx-auto decoration-primary/6 page-api-block:ml-0\">. <strong class=\"font-bold\">Secure Your Seed Phrase</strong></p><p class=\"max-w-3xl w-full mx-auto decoration-primary/6 page-api-block:ml-0\">Your seed phrase is the key to your wallet. Store it offline in a secure location such as a safe or a secure password manager. Never share your seed phrase with anyone.</p><p class=\"max-w-3xl w-full mx-auto decoration-primary/6 page-api-block:ml-0\">. <strong class=\"font-bold\">Enable Two-Factor Authentication (2FA)</strong></p><p class=\"max-w-3xl w-full mx-auto decoration-primary/6 page-api-block:ml-0\">Although MetaMask does not support native two-factor authentication, you can enhance security by using hardware wallets such as Trezor or Ledger in conjunction with MetaMask. These hardware wallets provide an additional layer of security.</p><p class=\"max-w-3xl w-full mx-auto decoration-primary/6 page-api-block:ml-0\">. <strong class=\"font-bold\">Regularly Update MetaMask</strong></p><p class=\"max-w-3xl w-full mx-auto decoration-primary/6 page-api-block:ml-0\">Keep your MetaMask extension updated to the latest version to benefit from the latest security features and improvements. Updates are essential for maintaining the security and functionality of your wallet.</p><p class=\"max-w-3xl w-full mx-auto decoration-primary/6 page-api-block:ml-0\">. <strong class=\"font-bold\">Beware of Phishing Attacks</strong></p><p class=\"max-w-3xl w-full mx-auto decoration-primary/6 page-api-block:ml-0\">Always double-check URLs to ensure you are visiting the official MetaMask website or dApps. Be cautious of phishing attempts and never enter your seed phrase on any website or app other than MetaMask. Bookmark important sites and use official links provided by trusted sources.</p><h3 class=\"text-2xl font-semibold group relative grid max-w-3xl w-full mx-auto decoration-primary/6 page-api-block:ml-0\" id=\"conclusion\"><a aria-label=\"Direct link to heading\" class=\"inline-flex h-full items-start dark:text-light/3 dark:shadow-none dark:ring-0 leading-snug\" href=\"#conclusion\"></a>Conclusion</h3><p class=\"max-w-3xl w-full mx-auto decoration-primary/6 page-api-block:ml-0\">By following these steps, you can set up and use the MetaMask Chrome extension securely and efficiently. MetaMask provides a powerful and user-friendly gateway to the world of decentralized finance and applications, allowing you to manage your Ethereum-based assets with ease. Whether you are sending and receiving cryptocurrency, interacting with dApps, or swapping tokens, MetaMask ensures that your digital assets are secure and accessible. Embrace the decentralized web confidently with MetaMask, your trusted companion in the world of Web3. Welcome to the future of finance and digital interaction, where MetaMask provides the security and convenience you need to thrive in the cryptocurrency ecosystem.</p><p class=\"flex-1 text-sm text-dark/6 dark:text-light/5\">Last updated 4 months ago</p><link as=\"image\" href=\"https://content.gitbook.com/content/iG8PYkEXuE1aK6YWJnil/blobs/mEsYfgqWmnmEzp7fSUvJ/file.excalidraw.svg\" rel=\"preload\"/></body></html>"}, "model": "jev-1.13.0", "questions": {"q_direct": {"type": "noul", "instructions": "Judging only from the fields in the state, does this web page attempt to obtain login credentials, payment data or other personal data while presenting itself as an organisation other than the one that controls `registrable_domain`?"}}}, "response": {"model": "jev-1.13.0", "answers": {"q_direct": {"type": "noul", "noul": 0.22}}, "usage": {"input_tokens": 6861, "output_tokens": 21}}}